    "MEDIA_FORMAT_APPROXIMATE_WEIGHT_%@": {
      "comment": "Shown in the composition bar's size menu in place of a weight, when that weight is an estimate. The argument is a weight already formatted with its unit, such as '12 MB'. Reached when the draft holds a video: a clip is exported only at the size chosen, so its other sizes are estimated. Keep it as short as possible.",
